OL,5,G1700 5 News with Dan Walker
OL,6,G1800 Cyprus: Jewel of the Med
OL,7,     FWe visit stunning Cyprus. With 11
OL,8,     Fmonths of sunshine, beautiful
OL,9,     Fbeaches and crystal-clear waters,
OL,10,     Fit's no wonder this former
OL,11,     Fplayground for the reek Gods
OL,12,     Fattracts four million visitors a
OL,13,     Fyear.
OL,14,G1900 Traffic Cops
OL,15,     FWith reoffending rates on the rise
OL,16,     Fin the UK, we follow the Traffic
OL,17,     FCops as they are increasingly
OL,18,     Ffaced with seasoned criminals,
OL,19,     Fexperienced at evading the law.
