OL,5,G2000 Street Cops: Catching the Yobs
OL,6,     FPolice Spaniel Bonnie is called in
OL,7,     Fto sniff out narcotics. Cops deal
OL,8,     Fwith an aggressive bloke who
OL,9,     Frefuses to go quietly. And a
OL,10,     Fsuspected drink driver spurns a
OL,11,     Fbreathalyser.
OL,12,G2100 Fare Dodgers: At War with the Law
OL,13,     FIn Nottingham, agents are pushed
OL,14,     Fto the limit by vaping 'tram
OL,15,     Fsurfers' causing trouble on the
OL,16,     Ftracks. In London, investigators
OL,17,     Fhunt a woman thought to owe more
OL,18,     Fthan #2k in fares (S3)
