OL,9,     Fsuspects linked to a crime group.
OL,10,     FIn Burnley, cops pursue prolific
OL,11,     Fshoplifting suspects.
OL,12,G2305 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FNear York, officers arrest a car
OL,14,     Ffull of suspects with a large haul
OL,15,     Fof drugs, heading for a music
OL,16,     Ffestival. Plus, a reckless driver
OL,17,     Fwith a history of violence tries
OL,18,     Fto outrun the cops.
