OL,5,G0005 Car Pound Cops
OL,6,     FWith exclusive access to car
OL,7,     Fpounds, police forces, local
OL,8,     Fcouncil enforcement agencies and
OL,9,     Fnational organisations, we track
OL,10,     Fcars as they are seized for a
OL,11,     Fvariety of offences.
OL,12,G0100 Cruise TV with LoveitBookit
OL,13,G0200 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,14,     FIn a custom-built mobile surgery,
OL,15,     FGPs have a busy week helping
OL,16,     Fpatients including a boy with an
OL,17,     Finverted chest, a woman with a
OL,18,     Fmysterious rash, and an injury
OL,19,     Fcaused by a horse.
